Z||000005||stimpy||12-17-2000||08:20 AM||||Hey Bandit, good to see more Oklas on the forum.  As far as shows go, the Fiero Club of OK does host a show of sorts every May at Ferguson Pontiac down your way. This last year was my first year for the show. I say this much, more input from volunteers would not be a bad thing.<BR>I encourage you to come to meeting for the FCO and be assertive about what you would like to see in a show.<P>On the lighter side, I would love to go hit some of the open class car shows during the spring and summer with another Fiero owner. I live in South OKC, maybe we could catch up to each other down in Moore or sumpin. LMK, peace... <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
